<title>USA: Grand Forks, N.D., won by Dain Bosworth.</title>
<headline>Grand Forks, N.D., won by Dain Bosworth.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth, Inc., said it won $4.530 million of Grand forks, N.D., refunding improvement bonds, Series 1996 B, with a true interest cost of 5.23 percent.</p>
